01", "name": "search_code_snippets", "content": "OBSERVATION:\nsklearn/utils/estimator_checks.py:check_estimator_tags_renamed\nsklearn/utils/validation.py:validate_data\nsklearn/datasets/__init__.py:__getattr__\nsklearn/datasets/_arff_parser.py:_sparse_data_to_array\nsklearn/cross_decomposition/_pls.py:PLSSVD.fit_transform\nsklearn/datasets/_arff_parser.py:_liac_arff_parser\nsklearn/utils/estimator_checks.py:check_estimator_tags_renamed\nsklearn/utils/validation.py:validate_data\nsklearn/datasets/__init__.py:__getattr__\nsklearn/datasets/_arff_parser.py:_sparse_data_to_array\nsklearn/cross_decomposition/_pls.py:PLSSVD.fit_transform\nsklearn/datasets/_arff_parser.py:_liac_arff_parser\nsklearn/utils/validation.py:validate_data\nsklearn/cross_decomposition/_pls.py:PLSSVD.fit_transform\nsklearn/datasets/__init__.py:__getattr__\nsklearn/datasets/_arff_parser.py:_sparse_data_to_array\nsklearn/cross_decomposition/_pls.py:PLSSVD.transform\nsklearn/datasets/_arff_parser.py:_liac_arff_parser\nsklearn/utils/estimator_checks.py:check_estimator_tags_renamed\nsklearn/utils/validation.py:validate_data\nsklearn/datasets/__init__.py:__getattr__\nsklearn/datasets/_arff_parser.py:_sparse_data_to_array\nsklearn/cross_decomposition/_pls.py:PLSSVD.fit_transform\nsklearn/datasets/_arff_parser.py:_liac_arff_parser\n##Searching for term \"_get_tags\"...\n### Search Result:\nFound code snippet in file `sklearn/datasets/__init__.py`.\nSource: Retrieved code content using keyword search (bm25).\n```\n  1 | \"\"\"Utilities to load popular datasets and artificial data generators.\"\"\"\n  2 | \n  3 | # Authors: The scikit-learn developers\n  4 | # SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause\n  5 | \n  6 | import textwrap\n  7 | \n  8 | from ._base import (\n  9 |     clear_data_home,\n 10 |     fetch_file,\n 11 |     get_data_home,\n 12 |     load_breast_cancer,\n 13 |     load_diabetes,\n 14 |     load_digits,\n 15 |     load_files,\n 16 |     load_iris,\n 17 |     load_linnerud,\n 18 |     load_samp